<title>MALAYSIA: AMMB Hldgs year net profit 559.7 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>AMMB Hldgs year net profit 559.7 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		559.7	   vs	    327.0</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     141.3	   vs	     83.6</p>
<p>    Turnover	     3,995.22	   vs	  2,560.89</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     1,018.34	   vs	    635.08</p>
<p>    Minorities less	111.85	   vs    less   69.15</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries gain   1.31	   vs	    nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)    17.5	    vs	     30.0</p>
<p>NOTE: AMMB Holdings Bhd is involved in merchant banking, hire-purchase and leasing, insurance, share broking and other activities. The group earnings per share was adjusted for a bonus issue and the dividend was based on an enlarged share capital after the bonus issue.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
